# ailabs.alfonzoanthony.com — Cursor project context

## What this is

React/Vite portfolio for **Alfonzo Anthony — AI Prompt Engineer**, cloned from the **AIVOR** Framer layout (light/dark workspace UI). Live site: https://ailabs.alfonzoanthony.com

GitHub: https://github.com/aa619172/ailabs.alfonzoanthony-com

## Tech stack

- React 19 + TypeScript + Vite 8
- React Router 7 (client-side routes; `public/.htaccess` for SPA on Hostinger)
- Tailwind CSS v4 (`@import 'tailwindcss'` + `@theme` tokens in `src/index.css`)
- No backend — contact form is local-only demo

## Commands

```bash
npm run dev          # http://127.0.0.1:5173
npm run build        # outputs dist/
npm run zip:hostinger  # ailabs-upload-linux.zip for manual Hostinger upload
```

## Routes

| Path | Page |
|------|------|
| `/` | HomePage — conversational ask bar + quick links |
| `/projects` | Projects list with search |
| `/projects/:id` | Case study detail |
| `/experience` | Work history |
| `/about` | About + hobbies + why work with me |
| `/about#hobbies` | Hobby gallery (personal art, not client work) |
| `/contact` | Contact form |
| `/cv` | Resume download |
| `/ai-agents` | Agent systems overview |

