## Design tokens (semantic — use these, not hardcoded hex)

- `bg-canvas`, `text-ink`, `text-muted`, `border-line`, `text-accent`
- `bg-surface` (cards), `bg-surface-muted`, `bg-primary` / `text-primary-fg` (buttons)
- `bg-screenshot` (dark frame behind project screenshots)

## Content conventions

### Case studies

Every case study in `caseStudyDetails.ts` follows:

1. **The problem** — what was broken or missing
2. **What I did** — first-person, natural language
3. **Outcome** — honest results only; no fake metrics

Project list blurbs in `content.ts` use the same problem → action → outcome voice.

### Featured projects (9)

`agent-orchestration`, `prompt-reliability`, `adversarial-prompt-lab`, `gpu-fleet`, `2timesacharm`, `credit-rise`, `ai-video-engine`, `crusoe-rippro`, `mockup-magic`

**Live-tested metrics (2TimesACharm only):** 16,653 reach · $26.53 ad spend · within 7 days

### About page personal story

`about.personalStory[]` in `content.ts` — artist + 20 years tech + prompting as art. Rendered in a **“Who I am”** card on AboutPage.

### Hobbies

Personal work only (painting, laser, paper mache, construction, prompting). Not client portfolio work. Images in `public/hobbies/`.

### Contact

Email: `contact@alfonzoanthony.com` (in `site.email`)

### Explicitly excluded from site

Outlier, Datannation.tech, Amazon MTurk AI training, contract AI training platforms.

## Project images

- Screenshots in `public/projects/`
- Use `ZoomableProjectImage` component — click to zoom, scroll to pan when zoomed, Ctrl+scroll to zoom
- Right-click and drag blocked; watermark + PrintScreen deterrence in viewer
- **No UX portfolio button** on case study pages

## Deployment

- **Auto:** push to `main` → GitHub Actions `.github/workflows/deploy-hostinger.yml` (FTP to Hostinger)
- **Manual:** `npm run build` → upload `dist/` contents or extract `ailabs-upload-linux.zip` into subdomain `public_html`
- Do **not** use Windows `Compress-Archive` for Hostinger (breaks `assets/` paths)

## Editing checklist

When adding a project:

1. Add PNG to `public/projects/`
2. Add entry to `caseStudies` in `content.ts` (with `previewImage`, optional `galleryImages`, `repoUrl`)
3. Add full copy to `caseStudyDetails.ts` (problem / what I did / outcome)
4. Case study page is automatic via `/projects/:id`

When changing copy, prefer editing `src/data/*.ts` over hardcoding in page components.

## Code style

- Match existing AIVOR patterns; minimal diffs
- Use semantic theme tokens, not `bg-white` or raw hex
- Page components in `src/pages/`; shared UI in `src/components/aivor/`
